# Storybook Documentation Standards

## Story Structure and Organization

### Story File Naming

- **Co-locate stories** with component files
- **Use component name** + `.stories.tsx` extension
- **Group related stories** in the same file
- **Export stories** as named exports

```typescript
// ✅ DO: Proper story file structure
// PersonnelFileCard.stories.tsx
import type {Meta, StoryObj} from '@storybook/react'
import {PersonnelFileCard} from './PersonnelFileCard'

const meta: Meta<typeof PersonnelFileCard> = {
  title: 'Documents/PersonnelFileCard',
  component: PersonnelFileCard,
  parameters: {
    layout: 'centered',
  },
  tags: ['autodocs'],
}

export default meta
type Story = StoryObj<typeof PersonnelFileCard>

export const Default: Story = {
  args: {
    personnel: {
      id: '1',
      name: 'John Smith',
      classification: 'secret',
      date: '1963-05-15',
      rank: 'Captain',
      serviceNumber: '12345',
      organization: 'NASA',
    },
  },
}
```

### Story Organization

- **Group by feature** in Storybook sidebar
- **Use consistent naming** for story variants
- **Include comprehensive examples** for all props
- **Document edge cases** and error states

## Component Documentation

### Meta Configuration

- **Set appropriate title** for component grouping
- **Configure layout** (centered, fullscreen, etc.)
- **Enable autodocs** for automatic documentation
- **Add tags** for categorization and search

```typescript
// ✅ DO: Comprehensive meta configuration
const meta: Meta<typeof VintageDocumentCard> = {
  title: 'Documents/VintageDocumentCard',
  component: VintageDocumentCard,
  parameters: {
    layout: 'centered',
    docs: {
      description: {
        component: 'Base component for all vintage document cards with classification badges and paper styling.',
      },
    },
  },
  tags: ['autodocs', 'documents', 'vintage'],
  argTypes: {
    classification: {
      control: 'select',
      options: ['unclassified', 'confidential', 'secret', 'top-secret'],
      description: 'Security classification level',
    },
    title: {
      control: 'text',
      description: 'Document title',
    },
    date: {
      control: 'text',
      description: 'Document date',
    },
    location: {
      control: 'text',
      description: 'Document location (optional)',
    },
  },
}
```

### ArgTypes Configuration

- **Define controls** for all props
- **Add descriptions** for prop documentation
- **Set appropriate control types** (text, select, boolean, etc.)
- **Include validation** for required props

## Story Variants

### Default Story

- **Show typical usage** of the component
- **Use realistic data** that represents real use cases
- **Include all required props** with sensible defaults
- **Demonstrate proper styling** and layout

### Variant Stories

- **Create stories for each prop variant**
- **Show different states** (loading, error, empty)
- **Demonstrate responsive behavior** with different screen sizes
- **Include edge cases** and boundary conditions

